{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0edfdf27-e739-8376-89d7-27fb6e806e1a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T14:15:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucille Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:14:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Priya. Lucille Conti. They put a new water meter in last month and this bill came and it's way higher than anything I've ever paid. It looks off to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:14:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can look into that. Is the account in your name, Ms. Conti?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:14:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I rent, but the water bill comes to me. And here's the thing, the meter's in a crawlspace. Nobody goes in there. I don't go in there, the landlord doesn't. So who's reading it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:14:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Newport's meters typically report through a transmitter, so someone doesn't have to enter the space. The jump could be a first reading on the new meter, or an estimate that caught up. I'd need to pull the account to see which."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'd say it's wrong. I'm one person down cellar doing one load of wash a week. And honestly, the upstairs neighbor plays drums at all hours, I'm not sleeping much, so I'm not exactly running a laundromat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:15:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll have the meter reading checked against the account history. Can I confirm a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:15:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:15:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:15:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And can you put the explanation in writing? I don't want it just over the phone. I want something I can hold onto."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:15:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll note the request, and the explanation will be sent to the mailing address on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:15:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Thanks, Priya."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T14:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
